# INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md — pro vibe-coding session v tomto repu

> **Tento soubor čte Claude Code / Codex CLI jako PRVNÍ věc** v každé Pflanzer
> session. Bez něj AI píše code idiomaticky pro generic React app, ne pro
> konkrétní conventions tohoto repa. Updatuj při velkých změnách architektury.

## Auth pattern

```ts
// PŘÍKLAD — replace s realitou tohoto repa
import { useAuth } from '@/lib/auth';
const { user, login, logout } = useAuth();
```

- Provider: <Cognito | Auth0 | NextAuth | custom>
- Token storage: <httpOnly cookie | localStorage | Redux>
- Protected route helper: `<RequireAuth>` v `src/components/auth/`

## API client

```ts
// PŘÍKLAD
import { api } from '@/lib/api';
const data = await api.users.getProfile();
```

- HTTP lib: <react-query + fetch | axios | SWR | tRPC>
- Generated SDK: `<openapi-typescript-codegen | trpc | none>`
- Error handling: <RFC 7807 Problem Details | custom>
- Retry: <built-in | none>

## State management

- Local state: `useState` / `useReducer`
- Global state: `<Redux Toolkit | Zustand | Jotai | Context>`
- Server state: `react-query` v5
- Form state: `react-hook-form` + zod

## Logger / observability

```ts
import { logger } from '@/lib/logger';
logger.info('user.login', { userId, source });
```

- Žádné `console.log` v production code (lint enforced)
- Structured logs: `{ event: 'object_action', ...payload }`
- OTel traces: <true | false>

## Feature flags

```ts
import { useFlag } from '@/lib/flags';
const showNewFlow = useFlag('new-onboarding-2026');
if (!showNewFlow) return <OldFlow />;
```

- Provider: <LaunchDarkly | Unleash | Hypertune | env-based>
- All new features MUST be flagged.

## Folder layout

```
src/
├── components/      # shared UI primitives (Button, Input, Modal)
│   └── ui/          # design system components — re-use, neopisovat!
├── features/        # feature-scoped code
│   └── <slug>/      # Pflanzer variants land HERE
│       ├── components/
│       ├── hooks/
│       ├── api/
│       └── index.ts
├── lib/             # cross-cutting helpers (auth, api, logger, flags)
├── routes/          # routing (react-router / next pages)
└── test/            # shared test fixtures, render helpers, MSW
```

## Styling

- <Tailwind 3.4 | CSS Modules + tokens | styled-components>
- Design tokens v `src/lib/tokens.ts` (NEKÓDUJ inline barvy ani spacing)
- Brand voice: <link na brand guidelines>

## Testing

- Test runner: <Vitest 1.x | Jest 29>
- React tests: `@testing-library/react` + custom `render` z `src/test/render.tsx`
- API mocking: MSW v `src/test/server.ts`
- E2E: <Playwright | Cypress | none>
- Coverage threshold: 80 % branch (CI gate)

## Database / migrations (pokud relevantní)

- ORM: <Prisma | Drizzle | TypeORM>
- Migration tool: <Prisma migrate | Alembic | atlas>
- **Vibe-coded varianty NESMÍ generovat migrace** — DB changes do separate PR
  s `db-migration` label.

## CI / pre-commit

- `lefthook` runs lint + types + unit tests pre-commit
- Big PR test suite + Playwright runs in CI per push
- All gates must pass for merge to `main`

## Folder for Pflanzer artefakty

Pflanzer session artefakty (Charter, handoffs) drží v `docs/pflanzer/<slug>/`,
ne v root. Kód varianty v `src/features/<slug>/`. Po session 2 winner branche
se merguje, ostatní se mažou.
